Justice sought the death penalty one</text><text t="120240" d="7440" w="1" r="15" c="6">time.
One time. That is not justice. That is</text><text t="125600" d="6639" w="1" r="15" c="1">not what the American people deserve.
That is not what the families of victims</text><text t="129599" d="6000" w="1" r="15" c="1">of horrific murders deserve. And so, Mr.
